	(text "Board is USB powered. Arty PMOD VCC (pins 6, 12) is isolated from +3V3\nby open jumper JP601 to avoid back-feeding either regulator.\nDo not close with USB connected."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.44 81.28 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7a7acce2-8a31-5871-82e4-625f29df920f")
	)
	(text "Pmod I2S2 pinout (host = FPGA):\n  1-4  D/A row: MCLK, LRCK, SCLK, SDIN   = FPGA -> RT1010 (SAI1 RX)\n  7-10 A/D row: MCLK, LRCK, SCLK, SDOUT = RT1010 -> FPGA (SAI1 TX)\nAll clocks are driven by this board: the FPGA must treat JB1-3 and JB7-9 as inputs.\nJB1 (MCLK) and JB3 (SCLK) land on Artix-7 clock-capable pins E15 (SRCC) and D15 (MRCC);\nrun SAI1 TX synchronous to RX so JB3 clocks both directions."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 236.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8c12e3c7-4c15-552d-9b55-d384b3e8eec3")
	)
	(text "PMOD Type 2A (expanded SPI): RT1010 LPSPI1 is master by default;\nLPSPI PINCFG can swap SDI/SDO if the FPGA is master. INT on 7, RST on 8."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 218.44 248.92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a01afe8b-965e-5486-80ce-b49c9e2de751")
	)
	(text "Series terminations at the buffer outputs.\nY0 -> RT1010 SAI1_MCLK (GPIO_08)\nY1 -> RT1010 GPT2_CLK (GPIO_AD_03), async feedback\nY2 -> PMOD JB1 (MCLK, top row)\nY3 -> PMOD JB7 (MCLK, bottom row)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 109.22 0)
		(effects
